{"id":"71df01d9acb296bc","group":"58","path":"58/batch20/58-df-zfc-model10-skolem-function-code.md","title":"ZFC Model10 Skolem Function Code","display":"df-zfc-model10-skolem-function-code — ZFC Model10 Skolem Function Code","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-model10-skolem-function-code","aliases":["58-df-zfc-model10-skolem-function-code"],"display":"df-zfc-model10-skolem-function-code — ZFC Model10 Skolem Function Code","depends_on":["[[58-ax-zfc]]","[[58-df-function]]","[[../batch03/58-df-assignment.md]]","[[58-df-structure]]","[[58-df-satisfaction]]","[[../batch17/58-df-formula.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-model10-skolem-function-code"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-model10-skolem-function-code</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-model10-skolem-function-code — ZFC Model10 Skolem Function Code"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"58-ax-zfc\">58-ax-zfc</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"58-df-function\">58-df-function</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"64f35ba2e87964e0\" href=\"?note=64f35ba2e87964e0\" title=\"../batch03/58-df-assignment.md\">../batch03/58-df-assignment.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"d9b8711cda3f31ca\" href=\"?note=d9b8711cda3f31ca\" title=\"58-df-structure\">58-df-structure</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"8b6a90316aad78a4\" href=\"?note=8b6a90316aad78a4\" title=\"58-df-satisfaction\">58-df-satisfaction</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"65418b505fc53093\" href=\"?note=65418b505fc53093\" title=\"../batch17/58-df-formula.md\">../batch17/58-df-formula.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L\">\\(L\\)</span> (first-order language) and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal M\">\\(\\mathcal M\\)</span> (candidate <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L\">\\(L\\)</span>-structure)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"|\\mathcal{M}|\">\\(|\\mathcal{M}|\\)</span> (universe of the structure)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S(L)\">\\(\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S(L)\\)</span> (formula whose distinguished witness variable is <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"v_0\">\\(v_0\\)</span>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s\\in V\">\\(s\\in V\\)</span> with <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Assign}(\\mathcal M,s)\">\\(\\mathrm{Assign}(\\mathcal M,s)\\)</span> (total variable assignment)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f,H,\\operatorname{Val},\\operatorname{Sat}\\in V\">\\(f,H,\\operatorname{Val},\\operatorname{Sat}\\in V\\)</span> (function graph, assignment carrier, and semantic maps)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"y\\in|\\mathcal{M}|\">\\(y\\in|\\mathcal{M}|\\)</span> (witness variable bound in the assertion)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Struct}_S,\\mathrm{Univ},\\mathrm{Satisfaction}_S,\\mathrm{Fml}_S,\\mathrm{Var}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{Struct}_S,\\mathrm{Univ},\\mathrm{Satisfaction}_S,\\mathrm{Fml}_S,\\mathrm{Var}_S\\)</span> (structure, universe, semantic, syntax, and variable symbols)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Function},\\mathrm{Assign}\">\\(\\mathrm{Function},\\mathrm{Assign}\\)</span> and assignment update <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s[v_0\\mapsto y]\">\\(s[v_0\\mapsto y]\\)</span> (sourced operations)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcModel10SkolemFunctionCode}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcModel10SkolemFunctionCode}_S\\)</span> (predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}model10\\text{-}skolem\\text{-}function\\text{-}code} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcModel10SkolemFunctionCode}_S(f,\\mathcal M,\\varphi,L)\\leftrightarrow\\exists H,\\operatorname{Val},\\operatorname{Sat}\\in V\\;\\Bigl[\\mathrm{Satisfaction}_S(\\mathcal M,L,\\operatorname{Val},\\operatorname{Sat})\\land\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S(L)\\land v_0\\in\\mathrm{Var}_S\\land H=\\{s\\in\\mathcal P(\\mathrm{Var}_S\\times\\mathrm{Univ}(\\mathcal M)):\\mathrm{Assign}(\\mathcal M,s)\\}\\land\\mathrm{Function}(f,H,\\mathrm{Univ}(\\mathcal M))\\land\\forall s\\in H\\;\\Bigl(\\bigl(\\exists y\\in\\mathrm{Univ}(\\mathcal M)\\;\\operatorname{Sat}(\\varphi,s[v_0\\mapsto y])\\bigr)\\to\\operatorname{Sat}(\\varphi,s[v_0\\mapsto f(s)])\\Bigr)\\Bigr]\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}model10\\text{-}skolem\\text{-}function\\text{-}code} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcModel10SkolemFunctionCode}_S(f,\\mathcal M,\\varphi,L)\\leftrightarrow\\exists H,\\operatorname{Val},\\operatorname{Sat}\\in V\\;\\Bigl[\\mathrm{Satisfaction}_S(\\mathcal M,L,\\operatorname{Val},\\operatorname{Sat})\\land\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S(L)\\land v_0\\in\\mathrm{Var}_S\\land H=\\{s\\in\\mathcal P(\\mathrm{Var}_S\\times\\mathrm{Univ}(\\mathcal M)):\\mathrm{Assign}(\\mathcal M,s)\\}\\land\\mathrm{Function}(f,H,\\mathrm{Univ}(\\mathcal M))\\land\\forall s\\in H\\;\\Bigl(\\bigl(\\exists y\\in\\mathrm{Univ}(\\mathcal M)\\;\\operatorname{Sat}(\\varphi,s[v_0\\mapsto y])\\bigr)\\to\\operatorname{Sat}(\\varphi,s[v_0\\mapsto f(s)])\\Bigr)\\Bigr]\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The formula is evaluated only on sourced total assignments.  The Skolem graph chooses a witness for the fixed variable <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"v_0\">\\(v_0\\)</span> whenever one exists, so no finite tuple is passed to the satisfaction map as though it were an assignment.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-ax-zfc","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-ax-zfc]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-function","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-function]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch03/58-df-assignment.md","status":"resolved","id":"64f35ba2e87964e0","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch03/58-df-assignment.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-structure","status":"resolved","id":"d9b8711cda3f31ca","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-structure]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-satisfaction","status":"resolved","id":"8b6a90316aad78a4","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-satisfaction]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch17/58-df-formula.md","status":"resolved","id":"65418b505fc53093","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch17/58-df-formula.md]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"L","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal M","display":false},{"tex":"L","display":false},{"tex":"|\\mathcal{M}|","display":false},{"tex":"\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S(L)","display":false},{"tex":"v_0","display":false},{"tex":"s\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Assign}(\\mathcal M,s)","display":false},{"tex":"f,H,\\operatorname{Val},\\operatorname{Sat}\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"y\\in|\\mathcal{M}|","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Struct}_S,\\mathrm{Univ},\\mathrm{Satisfaction}_S,\\mathrm{Fml}_S,\\mathrm{Var}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Function},\\mathrm{Assign}","display":false},{"tex":"s[v_0\\mapsto y]","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcModel10SkolemFunctionCode}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}model10\\text{-}skolem\\text{-}function\\text{-}code} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcModel10SkolemFunctionCode}_S(f,\\mathcal M,\\varphi,L)\\leftrightarrow\\exists H,\\operatorname{Val},\\operatorname{Sat}\\in V\\;\\Bigl[\\mathrm{Satisfaction}_S(\\mathcal M,L,\\operatorname{Val},\\operatorname{Sat})\\land\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S(L)\\land v_0\\in\\mathrm{Var}_S\\land H=\\{s\\in\\mathcal P(\\mathrm{Var}_S\\times\\mathrm{Univ}(\\mathcal M)):\\mathrm{Assign}(\\mathcal M,s)\\}\\land\\mathrm{Function}(f,H,\\mathrm{Univ}(\\mathcal M))\\land\\forall s\\in H\\;\\Bigl(\\bigl(\\exists y\\in\\mathrm{Univ}(\\mathcal M)\\;\\operatorname{Sat}(\\varphi,s[v_0\\mapsto y])\\bigr)\\to\\operatorname{Sat}(\\varphi,s[v_0\\mapsto f(s)])\\Bigr)\\Bigr]","display":true},{"tex":"v_0","display":false}],"bytes":2252,"backlinks":[{"id":"0494a2630c9bee7c","anchor":"ref-7","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{ZfcModel10SkolemFunctionCode}_S(f,M,\\varphi,L)$（带语言和公式参数的 Skolem 函数编码，见 [[../batch20/58-df-zfc-model10-skolem-function-code.md]]）"},{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-2732","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch20/58-df-zfc-model10-skolem-function-code.md|58-df-zfc-model10-skolem-function-code]]（batch20）"}],"outgoing":["a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","36d7463d215be751","64f35ba2e87964e0","d9b8711cda3f31ca","8b6a90316aad78a4","65418b505fc53093"]}